# -*- mode: org -*-
* Emacs Config
=foxy.el=: competitive programming package for emacs that I'm working on.

I have a custom minimal theme with different shades, here's one of them illustrated.
They're targeted to be ~monochromatic~ with an optional toggle for when I need a rainbow salad.
The different variants are /light/, /amber/ (inspired by plan9), /dark/ and /burn/; to be used in accordance with background light/environment.

